the person in charge of J Weekly.

812
00:39:13,520 --> 00:39:14,880
Thank you, Daisy.

813
00:39:15,040 --> 00:39:17,040
I'm honored to work with the Rehab Club

814
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:19,040
on this charity fundraising event.

815
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:23,520
Too bad Miss Lok of the Rehab Club
can't join us today

816
00:39:23,680 --> 00:39:27,360
but it won't affect our incredible show.

817
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:29,120
Are you ready?

818
00:39:29,240 --> 00:39:30,720
Yeah...

819
00:39:30,880 --> 00:39:32,320
Let's hear it...

820
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:34,000
Come on...

821
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:38,000
Jarvis is ready to inhale pure oxygen,

822
00:39:38,160 --> 00:39:40,400
and the Static Apnea Challenge
will soon begin.

823
00:39:42,920 --> 00:39:45,600
I wonder what prank Jarvis will pull today.

824
00:39:45,760 --> 00:39:46,760
I don't know.

825
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:09,520
What's going on?

826
00:40:09,680 --> 00:40:10,800
What did you give him?

827
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:16,480
I know...Jarvis is toying with us...

828
00:40:16,560 --> 00:40:18,800
So, this is the prank?

829
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:21,360
Ngai Ka-yan, what an act!

830
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:23,040
You can quit now and get up...

831
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:27,680
Jarvis...

832
00:40:31,720 --> 00:40:34,480
He's not breathing...Jarvis...

833
00:40:34,560 --> 00:40:36,080
Jarvis...

834
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:37,520
Get up, Jarvis...

835
00:40:37,680 --> 00:40:38,400
Is everything OK?

836
00:40:38,560 --> 00:40:39,280
Jarvis...

837
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:40,800
Are you OK? You're scaring us!

838
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:42,000
Wake up...

839
00:40:42,120 --> 00:40:44,120
Wake up! Stop it...

840
00:40:44,240 --> 00:40:46,000
Jarvis...

841
00:40:46,160 --> 00:40:46,960
How is he?

842
00:40:47,080 --> 00:40:48,960
Get up...

843
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:51,200
(Three months later)

844
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:53,360
Ngai Ka-yan was dead? Just like that?

845
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:54,720
How bizarre!

846
00:40:54,840 --> 00:40:58,480
We found out Tom and Paul meant to
pull a prank on him

847
00:40:58,600 --> 00:40:59,680
and give him a stink bomb.

848
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:03,040
But we never disclosed this to the public.

849
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:05,720
J Weekly had an Static Apnea
Challenge before,

850
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:08,200
they meant to use one of these
to trick one of their own.

851
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:11,760
But these kids mentioned this
on their video.

852
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,160
Something is fishy.

853
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:16,480
I searched Agent J Channel's IP address.

854
00:41:16,680 --> 00:41:18,800
It should be in this building.

855
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:21,280
Their base is here? Go find them.

856
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:34,720
We got something. Cut him off.

857
00:42:02,160 --> 00:42:03,040
Police! Freeze!

858
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:04,880
Stop running!

859
00:42:05,680 --> 00:42:07,360
Stay where you are!

860
00:42:16,720 --> 00:42:17,760
Looking for me?

861
00:42:18,440 --> 00:42:19,520
Over here.

862
00:42:20,400 --> 00:42:22,480
Gogo Sir, right?

863
00:42:22,600 --> 00:42:23,720
Say something, Sir!

864
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:25,520
You're on live...I'll give you a close up...

865
00:42:25,640 --> 00:42:26,480
Hey...

866
00:42:26,640 --> 00:42:28,720
Watch it! Don't break anything!

867
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:30,000
That's personal property.

868
00:42:30,560 --> 00:42:31,440
Want to make an arrest?

869
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:32,480
How many cuffs do you have?

870
00:42:32,560 --> 00:42:33,840
Arrest me, Sir!

871
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:35,440
Go ahead and arrest me...
